title: "Maven Toys: Descriptive, Predictive and Prescriptive Analytics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Al-korj"
    given-names: "Mohammad"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
abstract: >-
  A five-page Power BI and Python analytics portfolio project
  using the Maven Toys Mexico Toy Sales dataset. The project
  integrates descriptive sales and inventory analysis,
  experimental 28-day demand forecasting, and forecast-driven
  inventory replenishment simulations under alternative budget
  and service-level assumptions. It includes an interactive
  Power BI dashboard, reproducible Python scripts, documented
  evaluation metrics, and scenario-based recommendations.
  Predictive and prescriptive results are retrospective
  simulations intended for analytical demonstration,
  not operational deployment.
keywords:
  - Power BI
  - Business Intelligence
  - DAX
  - Data Visualization
  - Retail Analytics
  - Inventory Analysis
